# Avengers Assemble!: "if you attacked with a Hero this turn" asks the creature as it was declared (CR 508.1), whatever
# became of it. Bot1's Masked Meower entered on turn 1 (before the Avengers: no draw then, nor at Bot2's end step on turn
# 2). On turn 3 Bot1 flashes the Avengers in during its upkeep (CR 702.8a: not a time it could cast an enchantment
# without flash), attacks with the Meower (a 3/3 Hero) and sacrifices it, discarding an Island and drawing a card, before
# the end step: at that end step Bot1 draws for the Hero that attacked. Turn 4's end step, with
# Hero turn-1 entry and turn-3 attack both behind it, draws nothing: Bot1 holds the 2 cards left after turn 1, the turn-3
# draw and the end-step draw, 3 in all.

